  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium high heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and bell pepper and cook until they are soft.",
    "Add the sliced chorizo and cook until it is browned.",
    "Add the marmite and mustard and stir to combine.",
    "Add the chopped candy and stir to combine.",
    "Warm the tortillas by wrapping them in a damp paper towel and microwaving for 20 seconds.",
    "Assemble the tacos by spooning the chorizo mixture onto a tortilla and serving immediately.",
    "Serve the tacos hot and enjoy."
